Not bundled
-----------

The editor also uses shiny, bslib (Bootstrap 5), shinyjs, htmlwidgets and
htmltools, which are R package dependencies installed separately and not
included in DataEditR. The logo's lettering is set in Inter (SIL Open Font
Licence 1.1) and converted to outlines; no font files are included.
